​I'd say that's using a sledgehammer to swat a fly. Fwiw, here's the code in base graphics:

a <- 1:12; b <- -2:9
plot(a, b, pch = 16, col = "blue", xaxt = "n", bty = "n", xlim = c(0,14), ylim = c(-4,10), xaxs = "i")
axis(1, pos = 0)​

Joyce

